<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia May reserves reach $20.987 billion.</title>
<headline>Indonesia May reserves reach $20.987 billion.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's foreign exchange reserves rose to $20.987 billion in May from $20.382 billion in April, a government official said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our reserve rose to $20.987 billion in May,&quot; the official said. Indonesia's foreign reserves totalled $19.872 billion in March and $19.862 billion in February.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
